			(property "Description" "Generic connector, single row, 01x08 -- [wb] PLACEHOLDER for a keyed board-to-board/harness connector (split-architecture hot-cluster<->cool-control boundary, mid-flight owner directive 2026-07-16; real keyed CLASS/MPN pending the split-architecture ratification) AND the shared SPI-LCD header pinout (main + bay chain, DESIGN-SHEET.md sec C.23): 1=GND 2=+3V3/backlight-PWM-domain 3=SCK 4=SDI(MOSI) 5=RESET 6=DC 7=CS 8=BACKLIGHT_PWM, OR for a rail-level bank harness: 1=GND 2=+3V3_LOGIC 3..7=per-group CTRL 8=shared TRIP_OUT (wired-OR) -- pin map is PER-INSTANCE, see the generator leaf notes."
